WEBVTT

00:00:05.420 --> 00:00:08.220
Darling, open up your eyes!

00:00:05.420 --> 00:00:08.220
Darling me wo akete

00:00:08.220 --> 00:00:10.550
It is in this world's evil den

00:00:08.220 --> 00:00:10.550
Kono yo no aku no soukutsu de

00:00:10.550 --> 00:00:15.470
You shall receive a rare heart

00:00:10.550 --> 00:00:15.470
Tsuibamareru kokoro hoshikute

00:00:15.470 --> 00:00:18.310
Escaping is impossible

00:00:15.470 --> 00:00:18.310
Nige mo dekinu

00:00:18.310 --> 00:00:20.690
My imprisoned, pale-faced prince

00:00:18.310 --> 00:00:20.690
Yuuhei no souhaku no ouji yo

00:00:20.690 --> 00:00:25.650
I am a goddess

00:00:20.690 --> 00:00:25.650
Watashi ga megami

00:00:25.650 --> 00:00:28.150
Kami-chama Karin

00:00:25.650 --> 00:00:28.150
Mini-Goddess Karin

00:00:28.300 --> 00:00:30.940
In this ward, you have to poach everything

00:00:28.300 --> 00:00:30.940
Subete wa mitsuryouku

00:00:30.940 --> 00:00:33.320
With a hidden snare

00:00:30.940 --> 00:00:33.320
Usumoreta wana ni

00:00:33.320 --> 00:00:35.030
If you entrap them

00:00:33.320 --> 00:00:35.030
Hamerareru no nara

00:00:35.030 --> 00:00:38.450
You'll want to destroy them too…

00:00:35.030 --> 00:00:38.450
Konagona ni kudaite hoshii wa

00:00:38.450 --> 00:00:40.910
To die from natural causes or imcompetence

00:00:38.450 --> 00:00:40.910
Shi ni itaranu yamai

00:00:40.910 --> 00:00:43.450
It's all poison to your heart

00:00:40.910 --> 00:00:43.450
Shinzou ni ha pawazon

00:00:43.450 --> 00:00:46.120
A rose melting in the flames of purgatory

00:00:43.450 --> 00:00:46.120
Rengoku no homura de zero kara

00:00:46.120 --> 00:00:48.370
Let's redeem this world…

00:00:46.120 --> 00:00:48.370
Saisei shimashou

00:00:48.370 --> 00:00:53.420
A black dahlia in the nightless city's sky

00:00:48.370 --> 00:00:53.420
Fuyoru no sora de kuroi daria

00:00:53.420 --> 00:00:56.210
A lost delusion, a falling reality

00:00:53.420 --> 00:00:56.210
Shisuru mousou ochiru genjitsu

00:00:56.210 --> 00:00:59.090
Struggling in hell like an ant

00:00:56.210 --> 00:00:59.090
Mogake ari jigoku

00:01:01.050 --> 00:01:03.800
Darling, give me your voice!

00:01:01.050 --> 00:01:03.800
Darling koe agete

00:01:03.800 --> 00:01:06.100
For right now, our limits will have to change

00:01:03.800 --> 00:01:06.100
Kono ima sashichigaeru hodo

00:01:06.100 --> 00:01:11.060
If we want for the most important thing

00:01:06.100 --> 00:01:11.060
Daiji na mono ga hoshii no nara

00:01:11.060 --> 00:01:13.860
Discover the result of your prayers

00:01:11.060 --> 00:01:13.860
Inori wa hatete

00:01:13.860 --> 00:01:16.230
Your princess is dying in prison

00:01:13.860 --> 00:01:16.230
Rougoku de shouten no himegimi

00:01:16.230 --> 00:01:21.280
You are such a devil…

00:01:16.230 --> 00:01:21.280
Anata ga maou

00:01:21.280 --> 00:01:23.780
Hate's fist and grief's wounds, too

00:01:21.280 --> 00:01:23.780
Ikari no ken mo nageki no kizu mo

00:01:23.780 --> 00:01:29.960
Dissolving, vanishing, unraveling, passing away, without a trace

00:01:23.780 --> 00:01:29.960
Atokata mo naku tokete kiete chitte utakata

00:03:00.890 --> 00:03:05.200
The Ring has disappeared

00:03:06.070 --> 00:03:09.610
Gone! Gone! Gone! Gone!

00:03:13.360 --> 00:03:16.950
Gone! Gone! Gone! Gone!

00:03:16.980 --> 00:03:19.250
What's the matter, Karin-chan?

00:03:19.250 --> 00:03:22.580
The ring is gone!

00:03:25.040 --> 00:03:29.460
Even though that ring is the precious memento my Mom left me…

00:03:35.220 --> 00:03:39.310
Without that ring… I'm… I'm…

00:03:45.940 --> 00:03:47.770
This isn't the time to be doing weird things!

00:03:47.770 --> 00:03:50.290
It's a serious problem that I can't find it!

00:03:50.290 --> 00:03:57.120
It's precious to me, but more importantly if Kazune-kun found out I lost it…

00:03:57.450 --> 00:03:59.790
What?! You lost it!?

00:04:02.790 --> 00:04:05.460
People like you…

00:04:08.380 --> 00:04:13.010
Do you have any idea how precious the ring of a god is?!

00:04:13.010 --> 00:04:15.850
I do! I do!

00:04:15.850 --> 00:04:17.550
No, you don't!

00:04:17.550 --> 00:04:20.060
This is why girls…

00:04:23.310 --> 00:04:25.730
Kazune-san would have a riot…

00:04:25.730 --> 00:04:28.310
I'm scared! I'm scared!

00:04:28.310 --> 00:04:31.480
You have to find it Karin-chan!

00:04:31.480 --> 00:04:32.780
Y-Yeah!

00:04:33.820 --> 00:04:39.280
Ta-da! Detective Karin-chan has arrived!

00:04:39.280 --> 00:04:41.370
And her assistant Nyato-san.

00:04:43.830 --> 00:04:46.330
I had it at the school festival…

00:04:46.330 --> 00:04:49.500
So it must have been lost… after that.

00:04:49.500 --> 00:04:52.760
The possibility of it being in this room is large.

00:04:53.970 --> 00:04:55.800
What's with this room?

00:04:56.300 --> 00:05:00.100
It's so messy… was it a thief?

00:05:00.100 --> 00:05:03.270
Karin-chan, you made this mess yourself.

00:05:03.640 --> 00:05:05.180
Oh, really?

00:05:06.060 --> 00:05:09.020
It looks like we need a big cleaning first!

00:05:09.020 --> 00:05:11.770
Right, we better clean up…

00:05:48.310 --> 00:05:51.310
The ring isn't anywhere…

00:05:51.310 --> 00:05:54.030
Hey, look here! How nostalgic…

00:05:54.030 --> 00:05:58.610
Geez, if you don't take care of this seriously we'll never clean up!

00:05:58.610 --> 00:06:01.870
Shii-chan they're pictures of my childhood!

00:06:03.280 --> 00:06:06.330
Nya~ Karin-chan so lovely!

00:06:07.370 --> 00:06:08.580
I guess.

00:06:08.580 --> 00:06:11.790
There was a time when Karin-chan was this cute!

00:06:13.340 --> 00:06:15.260
What exactly do you mean by that?

00:06:15.840 --> 00:06:21.010
- I was just kidding.

00:06:19.260 --> 00:06:21.010
- Karin-chan.

00:06:22.100 --> 00:06:26.520
My… in the middle of cleaning?

00:06:27.230 --> 00:06:28.390
Himeka-chan.

00:06:28.390 --> 00:06:29.770
Look at this.

00:06:30.600 --> 00:06:39.490
Wow, it's young Karin-chan… how cute!

00:06:39.490 --> 00:06:41.910
I found it while cleaning.

00:06:41.910 --> 00:06:46.790
It's fun to look at photo albums, isn't it?

00:06:47.290 --> 00:06:49.250
Ah, I know!

00:06:49.330 --> 00:06:51.620
Wait here for a second!

00:06:52.540 --> 00:06:56.500
I'm going to go get my albums too!

00:07:02.470 --> 00:07:05.430
Waa, super-cute!

00:07:05.430 --> 00:07:07.060
Is this Kazune-kun?

00:07:07.060 --> 00:07:09.390
The two of you are so cute!

00:07:10.850 --> 00:07:16.730
To think this cute kid became such a jerk… unbelievable!

00:07:16.730 --> 00:07:17.730
Sorry about that.

00:07:18.650 --> 00:07:20.650
Kazune-saurus!

00:07:24.820 --> 00:07:26.990
It's nothing…

00:07:28.660 --> 00:07:29.580
It's nothing!

00:07:29.580 --> 00:07:34.250
It's not nothing… your room is so messy…

00:07:34.880 --> 00:07:36.430
What were you doing?

00:07:36.430 --> 00:07:38.630
That's why I'm cleaning!

00:07:38.630 --> 00:07:40.510
Are you cleaning? How rare.

00:07:42.050 --> 00:07:46.260
It's not like Karin-chan lost anything…

00:07:46.260 --> 00:07:47.560
Shii-chan!

00:07:50.680 --> 00:07:56.560
No, I'd thought I should be more ladylike once in a while!

00:08:00.360 --> 00:08:01.070
Something's strange.

00:08:04.530 --> 00:08:05.240
A scent.

00:08:06.450 --> 00:08:07.450
I smell something.

00:08:07.450 --> 00:08:08.790
This is bad!

00:08:08.790 --> 00:08:11.370
Kazune-kun senses something!

00:08:11.370 --> 00:08:13.330
W-What should I do?

00:08:20.340 --> 00:08:22.260
I thought I smelt something…

00:08:23.340 --> 00:08:25.390
When did you buy this?

00:08:28.010 --> 00:08:30.430
Eel bread?

00:08:30.770 --> 00:08:34.520
I got it on the day I met Kirika-senpai…

00:08:34.520 --> 00:08:36.100
It's covered in mold.

00:08:39.270 --> 00:08:42.530
It's squeaky clean…

00:08:42.530 --> 00:08:45.280
Geez, clean regularly from now, okay?

00:08:45.280 --> 00:08:46.490
S-Sorry.

00:08:46.860 --> 00:08:49.520
In the end we never found the ring…

00:08:49.520 --> 00:08:51.910
We'll try searching at school tomorrow.

00:09:04.720 --> 00:09:09.100
I must have dropped it somewhere during the school festival…

00:09:43.590 --> 00:09:46.480
It's hopeless… I can't find it.

00:09:46.480 --> 00:09:48.050
What is it that you can't find?

00:09:50.390 --> 00:09:52.060
K-Kazune-kun!

00:09:52.060 --> 00:09:54.600
Nothing at all, nothing!

00:09:59.190 --> 00:10:00.360
Don't tell me you…

00:10:03.150 --> 00:10:07.110
Kujyou-kun! Look, look!

00:10:12.080 --> 00:10:16.290
We have the same rings!

00:10:17.500 --> 00:10:19.170
Those rings!

00:10:19.170 --> 00:10:21.170
Hey, what's with those?

00:10:22.040 --> 00:10:23.090
Does it suit me?

00:10:23.500 --> 00:10:24.800
We got them over there.

00:10:25.630 --> 00:10:27.590
You bought them!?

00:10:29.840 --> 00:10:31.800
Did you really bought them around here?

00:10:31.800 --> 00:10:35.010
Yeah, it was a wagon shop.

00:10:35.010 --> 00:10:38.230
That's strange, where did it go?

00:10:42.730 --> 00:10:44.650
That was a close one…

00:10:44.650 --> 00:10:47.240
It was the right choice to close the shop early.

00:10:47.400 --> 00:10:50.910
Nii-san… why sell the rings?

00:10:51.240 --> 00:10:57.250
If we do this, they'll be confused and won't notice we stole the ring.

00:10:57.370 --> 00:11:02.880
And anyway, with the proceeds we can improve on the scarce Student Council budget.

00:11:02.880 --> 00:11:04.790
Two birds with one stone.

00:11:05.750 --> 00:11:09.260
Afterwards we just need to find an opening, and defeat the Sun God.

00:11:10.130 --> 00:11:11.880
There's no shop around here.

00:11:12.430 --> 00:11:15.890
But it's true that we bought these rings around here.

00:11:15.890 --> 00:11:18.520
The Kazunezu don't lie!

00:11:18.520 --> 00:11:21.310
Let me look at those rings closely.

00:11:32.410 --> 00:11:35.200
No. None of these is my ring.

00:11:35.370 --> 00:11:37.660
How is it? Envious aren't you?

00:11:38.540 --> 00:11:40.040
We've finally attained it!

00:11:40.040 --> 00:11:46.000
The one we dreamed about… a ring the same as Kujyou-kun's!

00:11:46.420 --> 00:11:48.500
The ring… broke!

00:11:48.710 --> 00:11:49.570
What is this?!

00:11:49.570 --> 00:11:50.630
Defective goods!

00:11:50.630 --> 00:11:52.040
Where's that wagon shop?!

00:11:52.040 --> 00:11:55.090
Absolutely unforgivable!

00:11:55.090 --> 00:11:56.890
So, it was a fake.

00:11:57.350 --> 00:11:59.350
Karin, where's your ring?

00:12:00.730 --> 00:12:03.390
You couldn't have lost it, could you?!

00:12:03.770 --> 00:12:07.110
N-No, I just left it at home.

00:12:20.620 --> 00:12:24.830
I have to find the ring quickly, before Kazune-kun really finds out…

00:12:48.940 --> 00:12:50.110
Are you alright?

00:12:56.990 --> 00:12:59.620
C-Cute!

00:13:00.200 --> 00:13:05.080
He kinds of look like a young Kazune-kun from that photo…

00:13:06.830 --> 00:13:09.210
Ma-Mama!

00:13:09.590 --> 00:13:11.960
That's right, I'm Mommy.

00:13:12.510 --> 00:13:13.760
Not.

00:13:14.840 --> 00:13:16.510
Are you not?

00:13:18.680 --> 00:13:20.140
What's your name?

00:13:20.260 --> 00:13:21.350
Suzune.

00:13:21.350 --> 00:13:23.350
Are you looking for your mom?

00:13:23.350 --> 00:13:27.520
I have to find her soon or…

00:13:29.940 --> 00:13:30.860
A ring?

00:13:34.610 --> 00:13:36.030
Hey, wait a second!

00:13:45.080 --> 00:13:46.620
Where is this?

00:13:48.080 --> 00:13:51.340
Was there a place like this?

00:13:59.720 --> 00:14:00.710
Is it grilled
eel over rice?

00:14:01.790 --> 00:14:04.250
I am God!

00:14:07.960 --> 00:14:09.210
You moron.

00:14:08.190 --> 00:14:09.210
It's a croquette!

00:14:22.740 --> 00:14:23.910
Suzune-kun!

00:14:25.700 --> 00:14:30.630
Could you show me the ring you dropped earlier?

00:14:30.630 --> 00:14:31.790
Sure.

00:14:35.920 --> 00:14:37.720
It's not mine…

00:14:39.550 --> 00:14:42.470
It's a pretty ring. Thanks.

00:14:43.640 --> 00:14:47.200
I have to deliver this to my mom…

00:14:47.200 --> 00:14:49.640
I'll help you search for her!

00:14:49.640 --> 00:14:50.400
Really?

00:14:50.400 --> 00:14:51.480
Yeah!

00:16:07.100 --> 00:16:10.220
Hey, how about these silver glasses?

00:16:10.560 --> 00:16:11.890
I don't need glasses!

00:16:13.020 --> 00:16:15.400
It feels like a young glasses guy…

00:16:15.400 --> 00:16:21.360
Those guys… damn, damn them!

00:16:21.690 --> 00:16:27.780
Next time, I won't let them get away with just that!

00:16:27.780 --> 00:16:29.740
Sorry…

00:16:29.740 --> 00:16:31.870
You shouldn't cry.

00:16:31.870 --> 00:16:37.420
First graders… I'll do this and this!

00:16:37.750 --> 00:16:40.840
This! That! Bam!

00:16:41.260 --> 00:16:45.970
And I'll finish them like this…

00:16:45.970 --> 00:16:49.560
I'll beat 'em up good!

00:16:50.180 --> 00:16:55.100
They look exactly like Kazune-kun and Himeka-chan in that photo album from yesterday…

00:16:55.980 --> 00:16:58.440
They can't be real…

00:16:58.440 --> 00:16:59.230
I got it!

00:17:09.870 --> 00:17:11.660
I'm a praying mantis!

00:17:11.660 --> 00:17:14.120
Kama! Kamaaa!

00:17:14.710 --> 00:17:16.250
Kama? Kama?

00:17:16.670 --> 00:17:19.170
Kama! Kama! Kama!

00:17:19.420 --> 00:17:22.130
Who are you?

00:17:22.840 --> 00:17:26.430
Not anyone suspicious… kama!

00:17:26.430 --> 00:17:30.010
Suspicious indeed…

00:17:30.260 --> 00:17:32.850
Go… away!

00:17:37.480 --> 00:17:40.100
It really wasn't Kazune-kun…

00:17:40.100 --> 00:17:42.280
He wasn't scared at all.

00:17:45.240 --> 00:17:47.660
B-Bug!

00:17:49.120 --> 00:17:51.280
It looks like I went too far into the past…

00:19:05.860 --> 00:19:08.490
I got lost in time…

00:19:08.490 --> 00:19:11.820
Lost in time? I don't understand.

00:19:11.820 --> 00:19:17.580
I want to go past that door but that seed of chaos is blocking it…

00:19:20.540 --> 00:19:23.840
Alright! Leave it to the mini-goddess!

00:19:33.640 --> 00:19:36.100
If I had the ring, I could transform…

00:19:36.310 --> 00:19:38.060
Try using this ring!

00:19:39.230 --> 00:19:42.270
Mom said it had mysterious powers!

00:19:42.400 --> 00:19:43.730
Suzune-kun…

00:19:51.030 --> 00:19:53.530
I am God!

00:19:59.620 --> 00:20:01.410
I became a goddess.

00:20:01.410 --> 00:20:04.710
It's different than usual but it's cute!

00:20:12.470 --> 00:20:17.260
It's like the first time I transformed and couldn't control myself!

00:20:17.260 --> 00:20:22.060
Mom said there was a meaning behind the power!

00:20:22.060 --> 00:20:24.190
Meaning? What meaning?

00:20:24.190 --> 00:20:29.570
If you don't know the meaning, you can't release the true power!

00:20:29.610 --> 00:20:35.280
I see. I don't even know much about my own ring,…

00:20:35.280 --> 00:20:38.490
...there's no way I can use a new one!

00:20:52.720 --> 00:20:57.930
Who's saving us?..

00:21:08.770 --> 00:21:12.440
Gone! Gone! Gone! Gone!!!

00:21:14.070 --> 00:21:16.160
What's the matter, Karin-chan?

00:21:16.160 --> 00:21:19.700
The ring is gone!

00:21:19.910 --> 00:21:23.750
Huh? I have a strange feeling that this happened before…

00:21:25.160 --> 00:21:29.130
Mom said there was a meaning behind the power!

00:21:29.460 --> 00:21:34.050
If you don't know the meaning, you can't release the true power!

00:21:35.130 --> 00:21:36.970
Was that a dream?

00:21:42.770 --> 00:21:47.900
I… I told you not to bring bugs inside the house! I did tell you, right?

00:21:48.060 --> 00:21:53.570
But, it's cute. Look.

00:21:53.570 --> 00:21:59.700
Stop it! Because of that giant praying mantis in the past, I hate mantises the most!

00:22:08.040 --> 00:22:10.290
Not here either…

00:22:10.290 --> 00:22:14.050
Karin… what're you looking for?

00:22:14.050 --> 00:22:16.260
Ah… nothing…

00:22:21.760 --> 00:22:23.310
What happened to your ring?

00:22:23.560 --> 00:22:26.850
Well… uh, you see…

00:22:26.850 --> 00:22:28.650
…the truth is…

00:22:30.230 --> 00:22:34.690
What?! You lost it!?

00:22:50.030 --> 00:22:55.500
Totsuzen no sutorii hajimaru yo

00:22:50.030 --> 00:22:55.500
The story has suddenly begun…

00:22:55.500 --> 00:23:03.860
Ring hikari dasu

00:22:55.500 --> 00:23:03.860
…with the ring shining.

00:23:03.860 --> 00:23:09.280
Ate no nai tabiji wo kimi to

00:23:03.860 --> 00:23:09.280
I'm on an aimless journey with you,

00:23:09.280 --> 00:23:15.750
Saa, hashire

00:23:09.280 --> 00:23:15.750
Come, let's run.

00:23:17.250 --> 00:23:31.180
Ima ruriiro somatta kono omoi wo

00:23:17.250 --> 00:23:31.180
Right now, these azure feelings that have built up…

00:23:31.180 --> 00:23:34.640
Yume mite koi shite

00:23:31.180 --> 00:23:34.640
…that I've been dreaming of, and love…

00:23:34.640 --> 00:23:45.030
Sora made ukande hakanai anemone

00:23:34.640 --> 00:23:45.030
…are floating up into the sky, like a never wilting anemone.

00:23:45.030 --> 00:23:52.080
Todoku koto no nai tegami hoshi no you ni

00:23:45.030 --> 00:23:52.080
This letter that cannot be delivered, will become like a star…

00:23:52.080 --> 00:24:01.880
So yo kaze sayonara aa…

00:23:52.080 --> 00:24:01.880
Yes, it will have have to bid the wind farewell.

00:24:05.400 --> 00:24:10.500
The Mysterious Transfer Student is Cool

00:24:06.080 --> 00:24:07.910
Next time on Kami-chama Karin:

00:24:07.910 --> 00:24:11.000
The mysterious transfer student is cool!

00:24:11.330 --> 00:24:13.290
I saw it.

00:24:13.290 --> 00:24:15.540
Kazune-kun and the transfer student.

00:24:15.540 --> 00:24:19.210
T-T-T-They kissed!
